L381: ## Dataset
L382: 
L383: Each task in `verisoftbench.jsonl` contains:
L384: 
L385:   * Theorem name, statement, and source location
L386:   * Filtered dependencies (library defs, repo defs, local context, lemmas)
L387:   * Ground truth proof
L388:   * Metadata (category, difficulty metrics, Aristotle subset membership)
